eq 0$, then $\mathbf{w} = \mathbf{x} 	imes (\mathbf{x} 	imes \mathbf{y}) = (\mathbf{x} 	imes \mathbf{x}) 	imes \mathbf{y} = (\mathbf{x} 	imes \mathbf{x}) 	imes \mathbf{y}$ is also orthogonal to $\mathbf{y}$, a contradiction.
